    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/b6c875158fe21c979f0e8e67eda15dd1.avif?t=1715182240\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience <strong>Story-rich</strong> narrative game inspired by beloved fairy tales like Hansel and Gretel, The Three Little Pigs and more! it\u2019s up to you to guide the siblings to find their way and to uncover what mysteries await.<br></li><li>Explore the beautiful <strong>handcrafted </strong>world brought to life using wood, cardboard, foam and clay for a unique stop-motion style experience.<br></li><li>See the world through the <strong>cinematic </strong>camera angles designed to give you a stunning view at every location.<br></li><li>Play in this <strong>family-friendly single-player</strong> adventure that will enchant anyone looking for a bit of magic in their lives<br></li><li>Solve <strong>puzzles </strong>that creatively engages both characters, each with their own unique abilities, at once: Lift, climb, pull and push various objects to help the creatures and friends you find along the way.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/2b06e2039df8b61e8b38ddfabc191c6f.poster.avif?t=1715182240\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/2b06e2039df8b61e8b38ddfabc191c6f.webm?t=1715182240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/2b06e2039df8b61e8b38ddfabc191c6f.mp4?t=1715182240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/e0eb37418e48b9fa876b43dc5a07aa38.avif?t=1715182240\" /></div><br>After being abandoned by their parents, Hansel and Gretel wander the forest searching for their way home. This begins a journey through the dangerous forests, that they will find soon enough is inhabited by a hungry wolf prowling around.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/579e0aec4626880459de57796a9ed651.poster.avif?t=1715182240\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/579e0aec4626880459de57796a9ed651.webm?t=1715182240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/579e0aec4626880459de57796a9ed651.mp4?t=1715182240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Fret not! There are not only wolves in the forest but other fairy tale characters as well. Some take kindly to the children and try to help them while others\u2026 not so much.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/aed11c222477a2dd95c3272667dbef50.poster.avif?t=1715182240\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/aed11c222477a2dd95c3272667dbef50.webm?t=1715182240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/aed11c222477a2dd95c3272667dbef50.mp4?t=1715182240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Trials and threats await the poor children, but each challenge is an opportunity to grow. Hansel and Gretel will develop unique skills that will surely be useful in uncovering the secrets of this impressive land. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/8613f470dd9721af995c000541a54703.poster.avif?t=1715182240\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/8613f470dd9721af995c000541a54703.webm?t=1715182240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/8613f470dd9721af995c000541a54703.mp4?t=1715182240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>By putting their strengths together they may stand a chance surviving in this cruel world. It\u2019s up to you to find out!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/00a2110b1f1a83cd881a3a98c5a21523.poster.avif?t=1715182240\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/00a2110b1f1a83cd881a3a98c5a21523.webm?t=1715182240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/00a2110b1f1a83cd881a3a98c5a21523.mp4?t=1715182240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/b6c875158fe21c979f0e8e67eda15dd1.avif?t=1715182240\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience <strong>Story-rich</strong> narrative game inspired by beloved fairy tales like Hansel and Gretel, The Three Little Pigs and more! it\u2019s up to you to guide the siblings to find their way and to uncover what mysteries await.<br></li><li>Explore the beautiful <strong>handcrafted </strong>world brought to life using wood, cardboard, foam and clay for a unique stop-motion style experience.<br></li><li>See the world through the <strong>cinematic </strong>camera angles designed to give you a stunning view at every location.<br></li><li>Play in this <strong>family-friendly single-player</strong> adventure that will enchant anyone looking for a bit of magic in their lives<br></li><li>Solve <strong>puzzles </strong>that creatively engages both characters, each with their own unique abilities, at once: Lift, climb, pull and push various objects to help the creatures and friends you find along the way.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/2b06e2039df8b61e8b38ddfabc191c6f.poster.avif?t=1715182240\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/2b06e2039df8b61e8b38ddfabc191c6f.webm?t=1715182240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/2b06e2039df8b61e8b38ddfabc191c6f.mp4?t=1715182240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/e0eb37418e48b9fa876b43dc5a07aa38.avif?t=1715182240\" /></div><br>After bein