/apps/1032690/extras/8613f470dd9721af995c000541a54703.poster.avif?t=1715182240\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/8613f470dd9721af995c000541a54703.webm?t=1715182240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/8613f470dd9721af995c000541a54703.mp4?t=1715182240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>By putting their strengths together they may stand a chance surviving in this cruel world. It\u2019s up to you to find out!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/00a2110b1f1a83cd881a3a98c5a21523.poster.avif?t=1715182240\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/00a2110b1f1a83cd881a3a98c5a21523.webm?t=1715182240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032690/extras/00a2110b1f1a83cd881a3a98c5a21523.mp4?t=1715182240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
